### POST Email Notification
POST http://localhost:8160/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "message": "Welcome to our service!",
  "emailAddress": "user@example.com"
}

### POST SMS Notification
POST http://localhost:8160/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SMS",
  "message": "Your OTP code is 123456",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

### GET Summary (Public View)
GET http://localhost:8160/api/notifications/{{id}}/summary
Accept: application/json

### GET Detail (Internal View)
GET http://localhost:8160/api/notifications/{{id}}/detail
Accept: application/json

### GET Money Sample (Custom Serializer)
GET http://localhost:8160/api/money/sample
Accept: application/json
